WEBVTT

00:00.980 --> 00:03.480
<b>Special Invitation Ticket 
73rd Tokujo High Culture Festival 
Host: Tsugumi Narita 
Guest: Fumiya Tomozaki</b>

00:05.480 --> 00:08.690
<b>Tokujo Festival</b>

00:09.260 --> 00:12.450
<b>C'mon, relax those shoulders. 
And smile! Smile!</b>

00:12.450 --> 00:13.820
<b>R-Right...</b>

00:15.330 --> 00:19.490
<b><i>Well, I made it on an outing 
with Mizusawa. But now...</i></b>

00:19.760 --> 00:21.230
<b><i>Now to tackle Hinami's tasks.</i></b>

01:56.510 --> 02:00.850
<b>2nd Stage: Lv. 8 
Sometimes the main character can't enter 
the village of another species on his own</b>

01:58.460 --> 02:00.850
<b>Okay, first we do some flirting.</b>

02:00.850 --> 02:03.770
<b>Huh?! What about scoping out their festival?</b>

02:03.770 --> 02:05.730
<b>That's what we <i>say</i> we're here for.</b>

02:05.730 --> 02:08.390
<b>But if two guys come to an 
all-girls school festival,</b>

02:08.870 --> 02:10.400
<b>there's really only one reason.</b>

02:10.690 --> 02:12.230
<b>Are you serious?</b>

02:12.960 --> 02:15.630
<b>But jeez, I'm not sure I can just...</b>

02:16.650 --> 02:18.360
<b>Wait—Mizusawa?!</b>

02:18.360 --> 02:19.500
<b>Hi there!</b>

02:20.280 --> 02:21.960
<b>What's that? Looks delish.</b>

02:21.960 --> 02:23.410
<b>Did you bring that from home?</b>

02:23.410 --> 02:27.160
<b><i>That was fast! Extroverts 
are something else...</i></b>

02:27.420 --> 02:30.330
<b>Nope! We bought them here.</b>

02:30.330 --> 02:34.440
<b>Oh, yeah? I thought you two were 
just super into cotton candy.</b>

02:35.080 --> 02:35.920
<b>What the heck?</b>

02:35.920 --> 02:38.380
<b>You know, since you both liked 
it enough to bring your own.</b>

02:38.380 --> 02:40.500
<b>C'mon, as if!</b>

02:41.150 --> 02:43.410
<b>Hey, can I have a bite?</b>

02:43.410 --> 02:45.070
<b>No, I don't think so.</b>

02:45.070 --> 02:49.100
<b>Oh, I wasn't asking you. I 
was asking this girl here.</b>

02:49.100 --> 02:50.910
<b>Meanie!</b>

02:50.910 --> 02:52.630
<b><i>You'll</i> give me a bite, won't you?</b>

02:52.630 --> 02:54.770
<b>Well, I guess...</b>

02:56.280 --> 02:59.280
<b>Whoa! It tastes just like cotton candy!</b>

02:59.280 --> 03:01.280
<b>That's because it <i>is</i> cotton candy.</b>

03:01.280 --> 03:03.910
<b>Hey, what are you doing here, anyway?</b>

03:03.910 --> 03:05.710
<b>Did you come alone?</b>

03:05.710 --> 03:08.890
<b>Actually, I got separated from my friend.</b>

03:08.890 --> 03:11.370
<b>Let me know if you see him, okay?</b>

03:11.370 --> 03:13.240
<b>We don't know what he looks like.</b>

03:13.240 --> 03:15.680
<b>Oh! I'll send you a picture, then.</b>

03:15.680 --> 03:17.260
<b>And tell me if you see him.</b>

03:17.260 --> 03:19.850
<b>How should we be in touch? By snail mail?</b>

03:19.850 --> 03:21.090
<b>That makes no sense!</b>

03:21.090 --> 03:23.840
<b>Right, right. Then we'll do this.</b>

03:24.110 --> 03:25.080
<b>Um...</b>

03:25.080 --> 03:26.100
<b>What do you think?</b>

03:26.100 --> 03:27.850
<b>So it's snail mail after all?</b>

03:27.850 --> 03:30.960
<b>No, that's kind of a hassle.</b>

03:30.960 --> 03:34.580
<b>It is, yeah. And I don't 
want to share my address.</b>

03:34.580 --> 03:36.020
<b>So what do we do?</b>

03:36.280 --> 03:38.320
<b>I guess Litter would work.</b>

03:38.320 --> 03:39.560
<b>Better than snail mail!</b>

03:39.560 --> 03:40.650
<b>Okay!</b>

03:41.000 --> 03:43.290
<b>You're really slick, you know that?</b>

03:43.290 --> 03:47.200
<b>No, no! I'm just worried 
about my poor lost friend.</b>

03:47.200 --> 03:48.710
<b>Oh, of <i>course</i>.</b>

03:49.800 --> 03:50.780
<b>Later!</b>

03:50.780 --> 03:52.950
<b>Hope you find your friend!</b>

03:55.930 --> 03:56.670
<b>Well?</b>

03:57.520 --> 03:58.590
<b>What's my score?</b>

03:59.870 --> 04:02.090
<b>A perfect hundred.</b>

04:03.520 --> 04:06.720
<b>I mean, it all starts by 
striking up that conversation.</b>

04:07.120 --> 04:12.480
<b>That opening line isn't about what 
you say—it's <i>how</i> you say it.</b>

04:12.480 --> 04:14.100
<b>How I say it...</b>

04:14.480 --> 04:17.190
<b><i>According to Mizusawa, it went like this:</i></b>

04:17.190 --> 04:20.650
<b><i>When a stranger suddenly 
starts talking to someone</i></b>

04:20.650 --> 04:22.900
<b><i>who's not mentally prepared for it,</i></b>

04:22.900 --> 04:25.600
<b><i>that person won't be in listening mode.</i></b>

04:25.600 --> 04:29.450
<b><i>But after they acknowledge you and 
you can hold onto their awareness,</i></b>

04:29.450 --> 04:31.840
<b><i>you've got your first conversation.</i></b>

04:31.840 --> 04:36.000
<b><i>Once that's underway, 
just talk about whatever.</i></b>

04:36.000 --> 04:38.090
<b><i>You can ask questions—anything at all.</i></b>

04:38.090 --> 04:39.810
<b><i>And like with the cotton candy earlier,</i></b>

04:39.810 --> 04:43.520
<b><i>it's easy to get a response if you touch 
on something they have with them...</i></b>

04:43.520 --> 04:44.720
<b><i>if you're quick enough about it.</i></b>

04:45.370 --> 04:48.080
<b><i>You know, I did some pretty similar stuff</i></b>

04:48.080 --> 04:50.720
<b><i>as part of Hinami's assignments...</i></b>

04:50.720 --> 04:52.470
<b>Ramen</b>

04:54.360 --> 04:55.520
<b>Hey, uh...</b>

04:55.520 --> 04:58.270
<b>You like Hinami, right?</b>

04:58.630 --> 05:01.400
<b>Aoi? Yeah, I like her.</b>

05:01.900 --> 05:03.120
<b>What about it?</b>

05:03.120 --> 05:07.480
<b>I just... Here you are 
chatting up other girls...</b>

05:07.480 --> 05:12.420
<b>Aha. It's not like Aoi and 
I are dating at the moment.</b>

05:12.420 --> 05:15.040
<b>I-I know, but, like...</b>

05:15.440 --> 05:18.220
<b>I kind of feel like it's not sincere.</b>

05:18.220 --> 05:19.900
<b>Sincere, eh?</b>

05:20.510 --> 05:21.550
<b>Tell me, Fumiya,</b>

05:22.260 --> 05:25.010
<b>what do you think makes a guy attractive?</b>

05:25.010 --> 05:26.550
<b>L-Let's see...</b>

05:26.940 --> 05:31.580
<b>He keeps himself presentable, 
plays it cool... what else?</b>

05:31.580 --> 05:34.930
<b>He's good at taking the lead 
in conversation... Like that?</b>

05:35.300 --> 05:38.050
<b>Hey, three right answers! Nice.</b>

05:38.560 --> 05:39.440
<b>But you know what?</b>

05:39.820 --> 05:42.700
<b>The most essential aspect, 
more than anything else...</b>

05:44.170 --> 05:46.320
<b>Attractive guys attract people.</b>

05:47.150 --> 05:47.850
<b>Huh?</b>

05:49.070 --> 05:52.580
<b>Sewing Club</b>

05:49.710 --> 05:53.340
<b>If a guy's reasonably 
presentable and attractive,</b>

05:52.580 --> 05:55.580
<b>Love Fortunes</b>

05:53.340 --> 05:55.580
<b>staying cool will come naturally.</b>

05:55.580 --> 05:56.620
<b>If he's attractive,</b>

05:55.580 --> 06:00.830
<b>Ring Toss</b>

05:56.620 --> 06:00.830
<b>girls will feel like they have to act 
fast before someone else snaps him up.</b>

06:01.120 --> 06:04.840
<b>That's how being attractive winds 
up making you even more attractive.</b>

06:04.840 --> 06:07.220
<b>It's a hotness spiral.</b>

06:07.560 --> 06:13.000
<b>So I'm raising my value out 
there and playing it cool...</b>

06:13.000 --> 06:16.350
<b>until I eventually get Aoi interested in me.</b>

06:16.350 --> 06:17.480
<b>I get it now!</b>

06:17.480 --> 06:21.710
<b>Basically you're flirting with all these 
girls to boost your attractiveness</b>

06:21.710 --> 06:24.560
<b>so that Hinami will decide to notice you.</b>

06:24.560 --> 06:25.920
<b>Not exactly.</b>

06:27.010 --> 06:30.240
<b>I'm also playing the field because 
I want to. That's a big part of it.</b>

06:30.240 --> 06:30.990
<b>Hey!</b>

06:32.320 --> 06:34.280
<b>Oh, and one more correction:</b>

06:35.040 --> 06:37.200
<b>Aoi won't <i>decide</i> to notice me.</b>

06:37.200 --> 06:39.000
<b>I'll <i>make</i> her notice me. Right?</b>

06:39.220 --> 06:41.040
<b>Y-Yeah...</b>

06:42.000 --> 06:44.000
<b>Ultra-Scary</b>

06:44.000 --> 06:46.000
<b>Haunted House</b>

06:46.280 --> 06:50.400
<b>Hey, you came!</b>

06:50.400 --> 06:51.250
<b>Hey.</b>

06:51.250 --> 06:52.770
<b>H-Hi.</b>

06:52.770 --> 06:55.370
<b>Hey, you grew antennae!</b>

06:55.370 --> 06:58.020
<b>These aren't antennae. They're ears!</b>

06:59.010 --> 07:02.020
<b>I'm a cute li'l bunny rabbit.</b>

07:02.020 --> 07:05.260
<b>You're even apathetic about your 
culture festival, huh, Gumi.</b>

07:02.020 --> 07:12.030
<b>Scary
Haunted House</b>

07:05.260 --> 07:07.370
<b>That's an Apathy-nian for you.</b>

07:08.000 --> 07:09.130
<b>Apath-what now?</b>

07:09.130 --> 07:12.030
<b>Come see our ghosts.</b>

07:12.400 --> 07:14.160
<b>They're not exactly scary or anything.</b>

07:14.160 --> 07:16.790
<b>I wouldn't go around advertising that...</b>

07:16.790 --> 07:18.500
<b>Right?</b>

07:18.930 --> 07:21.710
<b>How's it going? See any cute girls?</b>

07:22.030 --> 07:22.800
<b>Huh?!</b>

07:22.800 --> 07:26.090
<b>Hey, why do you assume we're 
out here hitting on girls?</b>

07:26.090 --> 07:28.910
<b>I mean, two guys at a 
girls' school festival...</b>

07:28.910 --> 07:30.960
<b>why else would you be here?</b>

07:30.960 --> 07:32.830
<b>Eh, I'd say it's going so-so.</b>

07:32.830 --> 07:34.270
<b>See? I knew it!</b>

07:34.270 --> 07:35.580
<b>What about you, Tomozaki?</b>

07:35.580 --> 07:38.810
<b>Me? I'm not hitting on anybody.</b>

07:38.810 --> 07:42.310
<b>You don't have a girlfriend, do you?</b>

07:42.610 --> 07:45.790
<b>Check out my class! This is your big chance.</b>

07:49.340 --> 07:50.720
<b>My chance...</b>

07:50.720 --> 07:53.670
<b>You heard her, Fumiya. Shall we?</b>

07:53.670 --> 07:55.030
<b>Yeah, okay.</b>

07:55.030 --> 07:58.040
<b>Entrance</b>

07:55.030 --> 07:58.040
<b>Two guests? Right this way.</b>

07:58.290 --> 08:02.750
<b>Exit</b>

07:58.630 --> 08:01.630
<b>Thank you very much...</b>

08:01.630 --> 08:03.730
<b>That wasn't scary at all.</b>

08:03.730 --> 08:04.480
<b>Nope.</b>

08:04.480 --> 08:06.420
<b>Hey there!</b>

08:06.730 --> 08:09.050
<b>I see you found your friend.</b>

08:09.050 --> 08:12.050
<b>Hey, Mako and Sayaka!</b>

08:12.320 --> 08:15.000
<b><i>When did he learn their names?!</i></b>

08:15.000 --> 08:16.550
<b>Did you check out the haunted house?</b>

08:16.550 --> 08:18.970
<b>Oh, from Tsugumi's class?</b>

08:18.970 --> 08:20.670
<b>No, not yet.</b>

08:20.670 --> 08:24.310
<b>You definitely should go.
It's terrifyingly unscary.</b>

08:24.310 --> 08:27.120
<b>But a haunted house has to be scary!</b>

08:27.120 --> 08:29.570
<b>You can totally see all the ghosts, too.</b>

08:29.570 --> 08:32.460
<b>Okay, now to pull a Mizusawa...</b>

08:33.170 --> 08:35.810
<b>I-It's seriously not scary.</b>

08:35.810 --> 08:37.760
<b>Wow, really?</b>

08:37.760 --> 08:40.720
<b>Y-Yeah! It's... surprising, actually.</b>

08:40.720 --> 08:42.450
<b>Surprising, huh?</b>

08:46.360 --> 08:48.960
<b><i>I guess I'm not ready for this yet.</i></b>

08:48.960 --> 08:49.710
<b>Whoa!</b>

08:49.710 --> 08:52.220
<b>I bet those look amazing on you, Mako.</b>

08:52.220 --> 08:53.170
<b>Put them on for a sec.</b>

08:53.170 --> 08:54.220
<b>Huh?</b>

08:54.970 --> 08:57.680
<b>Oh, yeah! So flattering!</b>

08:57.680 --> 08:59.100
<b>Some compliment...</b>

08:59.380 --> 09:01.000
<b>Were those some kind of prize?</b>

09:01.000 --> 09:02.640
<b>Yeah, from the ring toss.</b>

09:02.640 --> 09:03.980
<b>These, too.</b>

09:07.310 --> 09:10.940
<b>Those glasses would look pretty 
killer on you, too, Mizusawa.</b>

09:15.790 --> 09:16.470
<b>Well?</b>

09:17.070 --> 09:19.080
<b>They really suit you!</b>

09:19.080 --> 09:21.260
<b>There's that non-compliment again...</b>

09:21.260 --> 09:23.580
<b>They really do look good, Mizusawa!</b>

09:24.020 --> 09:25.840
<b>Why don't I take a picture?</b>

09:25.840 --> 09:28.490
<b>Hey, good idea! Will you do the honors?</b>

09:28.490 --> 09:30.780
<b>Get in here, you two.</b>

09:32.080 --> 09:33.340
<b>You player!</b>

09:33.340 --> 09:35.400
<b>Can we put it on Pinsta?</b>

09:35.400 --> 09:38.140
<b>He's been getting into that lately.</b>

09:38.140 --> 09:39.600
<b>Well...</b>

09:39.600 --> 09:41.230
<b>Sure, I guess.</b>

09:41.230 --> 09:43.310
<b>Okay, here goes!</b>

09:43.310 --> 09:44.640
<b>Cheese!</b>

09:44.640 --> 09:45.680
<b>Ready!</b>

09:49.420 --> 09:51.800
<b>Those count as glasses, right? Good.</b>

09:53.190 --> 09:55.690
<b>Tokujo Festival</b>

09:55.920 --> 09:59.200
<b>Man, I wanted to see your 
game out there, Fumiya.</b>

09:59.500 --> 10:01.950
<b>Not at my current level, you don't.</b>

10:02.240 --> 10:04.110
<b>Your current level, huh?</b>

10:04.580 --> 10:07.220
<b>Don't be so down on yourself.</b>

10:07.220 --> 10:10.290
<b>You've been reading self-help 
books or something, right?</b>

10:10.290 --> 10:12.340
<b>Well, it shows.</b>

10:13.460 --> 10:15.340
<b>You didn't realize?</b>

10:15.760 --> 10:21.850
<b>You've been asking more questions 
lately—specific ones.</b>

10:22.080 --> 10:26.220
<b>Oh, and you found a good rhythm 
that makes you easy to talk to.</b>

10:26.220 --> 10:27.310
<b>R-Really?</b>

10:27.310 --> 10:28.340
<b>Yes, really.</b>

10:28.860 --> 10:29.980
<b>Huh.</b>

10:30.680 --> 10:35.760
<b>For someone so awkward to 
come so far so quickly...</b>

10:35.760 --> 10:39.070
<b>You must have worked hard, 
tackling one thing at a time.</b>

10:43.250 --> 10:46.080
<b>You can try to hide it, but 
I can see right through you.</b>

10:47.030 --> 10:51.040
<b>You've gotta admire a hard worker like that.</b>

10:51.390 --> 10:52.180
<b>I...</b>

10:52.180 --> 10:53.900
<b>Well, thanks.</b>

10:54.380 --> 10:56.550
<b>That feeling, right there...</b>

10:56.960 --> 10:58.980
<b>when someone says those things to you?</b>

10:59.510 --> 11:02.390
<b><i>That's</i> how you talk to a girl.</b>

11:02.660 --> 11:04.590
<b>Why, you...</b>

11:05.630 --> 11:06.890
<b>Later, Fumiya.</b>

11:07.650 --> 11:11.270
<b><i>Even if Mizusawa's last speech 
was couched as a joke,</i></b>

11:11.560 --> 11:15.740
<b><i>I was glad that someone 
had recognized my efforts.</i></b>

11:17.030 --> 11:19.030
<b>Bottom-Tier Character Tomozaki S2</b>

11:26.280 --> 11:28.290
<b>Selfie w/ Fuka Kikuchi</b>

11:28.530 --> 11:29.760
<b>Tomozaki?</b>

11:30.660 --> 11:32.200
<b>There you are.</b>

11:38.400 --> 11:40.420
<b>Um... how is it?</b>

11:41.030 --> 11:45.890
<b>Each character's introduction and 
features are so well organized.</b>

11:45.890 --> 11:47.380
<b>It's looking great!</b>

11:47.380 --> 11:50.130
<b>Now we can move ahead 
with stuff like costumes.</b>

11:50.130 --> 11:51.910
<b>Thank goodness.</b>

11:51.910 --> 11:54.560
<b>Oh, and I wanted to ask...</b>

11:54.560 --> 11:58.600
<b>About how much time will we have to perform?</b>

11:58.600 --> 12:01.820
<b>Good question. I'll have to check.</b>

12:01.820 --> 12:07.770
<b>Yes, please do. I'll need to adjust 
things with that time in mind.</b>

12:08.500 --> 12:12.230
<b>If I need to make it shorter, 
things will need to be cut...</b>

12:14.600 --> 12:16.920
<b>I'm looking forward to this culture festival.</b>

12:17.400 --> 12:22.540
<b>So am I. I've been indifferent 
about it until this year.</b>

12:21.800 --> 12:27.050
<b>My Unfamiliar Way to Fly</b>

12:23.030 --> 12:25.530
<b>To think that dipping my toes in just a little</b>

12:25.530 --> 12:28.370
<b>would change my point of view so much.</b>

12:32.320 --> 12:35.690
<b>Say, Kikuchi... how about 
we take a selfie together?</b>

12:35.970 --> 12:37.440
<b>A selfie?</b>

12:37.800 --> 12:40.860
<b>Like, "Ready to work hard on the play!"</b>

12:40.860 --> 12:43.760
<b>We'll get the script in the shot, too.</b>

12:45.070 --> 12:48.280
<b>Okay. If you'll do the honors...</b>

12:48.600 --> 12:50.960
<b>All right, then. Let's see...</b>

12:50.960 --> 12:52.550
<b>Can I come over there?</b>

12:52.550 --> 12:54.400
<b>Um... uh-huh.</b>

12:54.400 --> 12:55.540
<b>O-Okay, so...</b>

12:58.770 --> 13:00.160
<b>I-I'm sorry!</b>

13:00.160 --> 13:02.460
<b>No, i-it's okay.</b>

13:05.290 --> 13:06.910
<b>Um, the selfie?</b>

13:06.910 --> 13:08.500
<b>Oh, r-right! The selfie!</b>

13:09.280 --> 13:11.140
<b>O-Okay, here goes...</b>

13:11.140 --> 13:12.740
<b>Uh-huh...</b>

13:15.690 --> 13:17.520
<b>I'll send this to you later, okay?</b>

13:18.350 --> 13:19.160
<b>Okay.</b>

13:20.520 --> 13:22.780
<b>Sewing Room 2</b>

13:23.450 --> 13:24.900
<b>You're doing well!</b>

13:24.900 --> 13:27.290
<b>You've gotten a fair few likes, too.</b>

13:27.290 --> 13:28.530
<b>I guess so, yeah.</b>

13:28.880 --> 13:32.440
<b>Still, I never thought it would come to <i>this</i>.</b>

13:33.300 --> 13:35.540
<b>Glasses are glasses, right?</b>

13:35.790 --> 13:37.480
<b>True enough.</b>

13:37.480 --> 13:41.200
<b>Add in the selfie with Fuka 
that you showed me yesterday</b>

13:41.200 --> 13:44.300
<b>and that's all of your photo tasks. Congrats!</b>

13:41.550 --> 13:44.300
<b>Mini-Task: CLEAR! 
Create private Pinstagram and self-promote</b>

13:44.560 --> 13:45.500
<b>Thanks!</b>

13:45.500 --> 13:48.080
<b>You're not going to post the one with Fuka?</b>

13:48.080 --> 13:50.600
<b>She said she was too shy.</b>

13:50.600 --> 13:52.730
<b>That happens.</b>

13:52.730 --> 13:58.600
<b>Still, I didn't think you'd suggest 
performing a play with Fuka's script.</b>

13:58.900 --> 14:03.570
<b>I know I told you to approach the 
festival with enthusiasm, but...</b>

14:03.570 --> 14:07.650
<b>I would have wanted to do that even 
if it didn't tie in to a task.</b>

14:07.990 --> 14:12.740
<b>Well, as long as it gets you closer 
to your goals, anything goes.</b>

14:14.020 --> 14:15.370
<b>Hey, Hinami?</b>

14:15.660 --> 14:19.370
<b>You're so invested in getting 
me to live that normie life.</b>

14:19.370 --> 14:20.660
<b>Why is that?</b>

14:22.980 --> 14:27.260
<b>Don't you remember? The first 
time nanashi and NO NAME met.</b>

14:27.970 --> 14:32.790
<b>You were all, "You can't change 
characters in real life,"</b>

14:32.790 --> 14:34.470
<b>that it was a tier issue.</b>

14:34.960 --> 14:37.850
<b>Oh, that's right.</b>

14:38.140 --> 14:42.860
<b>I heard that and wanted to 
prove that <i>I</i> was in the right.</b>

14:43.130 --> 14:44.500
<b>That's all.</b>

14:46.350 --> 14:47.180
<b>What?</b>

14:47.870 --> 14:49.860
<b>You look like you're not buying it.</b>

14:50.110 --> 14:51.240
<b>I-It's just—</b>

14:51.490 --> 14:53.870
<b>I'm a sore loser.</b>

14:54.800 --> 14:56.630
<b>I mean, if you say so.</b>

14:56.630 --> 14:58.250
<b>But never mind that.</b>

14:58.810 --> 15:01.250
<b>Have you decided who you want to date?</b>

15:01.250 --> 15:02.780
<b>Well...</b>

15:02.780 --> 15:06.470
<b>You said you wanted to wait, 
so I gave you a grace period.</b>

15:06.470 --> 15:08.850
<b>You <i>are</i> thinking about it, aren't you?</b>

15:08.850 --> 15:11.130
<b>Yeah... I guess so...</b>

15:14.140 --> 15:21.520
<b>Small Goal: Who do you want to get closer to?</b>

15:14.610 --> 15:17.120
<b>I'll need your answer soon.</b>

15:17.120 --> 15:20.260
<b>At least <i>two</i> girls you'd like to date.</b>

15:20.260 --> 15:21.520
<b>Got it?</b>

15:22.930 --> 15:24.270
<b>Got it.</b>

15:25.480 --> 15:26.650
<b>Brain!</b>

15:26.650 --> 15:30.150
<b>Please just say yes and don't ask why!</b>

15:30.150 --> 15:34.200
<b>Out of the blue? No way! Tell me why.</b>

15:34.450 --> 15:38.620
<b>Well, turns out the track-and-field 
club is talking about</b>

15:38.620 --> 15:41.210
<b>doing a comedy bit at the culture festival.</b>

15:41.450 --> 15:44.080
<b>But I'm not in track.</b>

15:44.080 --> 15:48.340
<b>It's okay! I got permission 
to go outside the club.</b>

15:48.340 --> 15:51.220
<b>You're the only straight man for me, Brain!</b>

15:52.100 --> 15:54.970
<b>So please... will you do me this favor?</b>

15:56.180 --> 15:57.470
<b>Please?</b>

15:58.030 --> 15:59.600
<b>Hmm...</b>

15:59.600 --> 16:04.690
<b>Show maximum enthusiasm on all fronts</b>

15:59.930 --> 16:04.690
<b><i>"Show maximum enthusiasm 
on all fronts" it is.</i></b>

16:05.140 --> 16:06.690
<b>Yeah, sure.</b>

16:06.690 --> 16:09.100
<b>Oh, c'mon, isn't there some way—</b>

16:09.100 --> 16:09.570
<b>Wait...</b>

16:09.970 --> 16:10.820
<b>Huh?!</b>

16:10.820 --> 16:14.300
<b>You're the one asking. Why so surprised?</b>

16:14.300 --> 16:17.440
<b>It was just so quick and easy!</b>

16:17.440 --> 16:18.490
<b>Wait a sec...</b>

16:18.810 --> 16:23.500
<b>You're jonesing for more of our 
husband-and-wife routine, eh, Tomozaki?</b>

16:23.500 --> 16:25.250
<b>I am not.</b>

16:26.840 --> 16:30.400
<b>Th-That's my handpicked partner for you...</b>

16:30.400 --> 16:32.220
<b>Such sharp comebacks...</b>

16:32.530 --> 16:37.500
<b>But we won't have much time to practice, 
what with the class play and all.</b>

16:37.500 --> 16:38.600
<b>No sweat!</b>

16:39.020 --> 16:42.100
<b>Just leave it to me!</b>

16:43.550 --> 16:45.600
<b>Hey, Mimimi.</b>

16:45.920 --> 16:47.850
<b>Morning, Takahiro!</b>

16:47.850 --> 16:49.200
<b>Oh, and Fumiya.</b>

16:49.200 --> 16:50.780
<b>Don't you "oh, and" me!</b>

16:52.600 --> 16:54.720
<b>Hey, I heard from Gumi.</b>

16:54.720 --> 16:56.320
<b>She's coming to our festival.</b>

16:56.320 --> 16:58.030
<b>Wow, she is?</b>

16:59.530 --> 17:00.950
<b><i>Gumi?</i></b>

17:03.920 --> 17:07.810
<b>You'll need to rewrite your 
short story into a script,</b>

17:08.320 --> 17:10.670
<b>but you're still having a 
hard time with the climax?</b>

17:11.000 --> 17:12.670
<b>Y-Yes.</b>

17:14.160 --> 17:18.680
<b>Um... what exactly is giving you trouble?</b>

17:18.960 --> 17:25.270
<b>I can't decide if Libra, the hero, 
will wind up with Kris or Alucia...</b>

17:25.270 --> 17:29.190
<b>and what should happen to 
the one he <i>doesn't</i> choose.</b>

17:29.490 --> 17:35.150
<b>I think I might be... afraid 
to make that decision.</b>

17:36.150 --> 17:40.910
<b>Afraid of dictating that the relationship 
among the three should go one particular way.</b>

17:42.910 --> 17:44.500
<b>In that case—</b>

17:45.030 --> 17:48.110
<b>and this may just be my thinking here—</b>

17:49.520 --> 17:53.420
<b>which of the two would <i>you</i>
choose, if it were up to you?</b>

17:54.980 --> 17:57.430
<b>I don't think I <i>could</i> choose.</b>

17:58.290 --> 17:59.550
<b>No?</b>

17:59.550 --> 18:05.200
<b>Maybe I personally have 
an idea of what I'd do.</b>

18:05.200 --> 18:07.810
<b>But what should I do as 
far as the story goes?</b>

18:07.810 --> 18:17.570
<b>My Unfamiliar Way to Fly</b>

18:08.530 --> 18:14.240
<b>Where could I take the characters 
that would be best for their world?</b>

18:14.240 --> 18:17.570
<b>These are the kinds of 
things I need to consider.</b>

18:17.570 --> 18:21.070
<b>Best for their world, huh?</b>

18:21.070 --> 18:26.080
<b>It feels kind of insincere to 
let my feelings get in the way.</b>

18:26.400 --> 18:27.580
<b>Hmm...</b>

18:32.320 --> 18:34.710
<b>Um, Tomozaki?</b>

18:35.880 --> 18:41.010
<b>Isn't there someone that you like?</b>

18:41.610 --> 18:42.850
<b>M-M-Me?</b>

18:43.200 --> 18:45.810
<b>Yes. You.</b>

18:45.810 --> 18:49.940
<b>I-I... well... good question.</b>

18:51.440 --> 18:56.690
<b>If you had two or more 
special people in your life,</b>

18:56.690 --> 19:00.120
<b>and you could only choose one of them...</b>

19:01.460 --> 19:05.580
<b>How would you choose that one person?</b>

19:09.280 --> 19:12.580
<b>Probably, if I'm being honest...</b>

19:12.870 --> 19:13.670
<b>Yes?</b>

19:14.870 --> 19:16.320
<b>I think I'm...</b>

19:16.830 --> 19:20.590
<b>I'm not in a position to make 
that choice in the first place.</b>

19:23.180 --> 19:26.920
<b><i>Right. That's how I truly feel.</i></b>

19:27.970 --> 19:31.190
<b><i>Hinami keeps grilling me about who I choose,</i></b>

19:31.520 --> 19:35.190
<b><i>even coming up with that hypothetical 
about girls confessing their love.</i></b>

19:35.190 --> 19:39.260
<b><i>But I've kept putting my answer on hold.</i></b>

19:39.260 --> 19:42.770
<b><i>Because deep inside, that's how I feel.</i></b>

19:43.450 --> 19:48.240
<b><i>For 17 years, this bottom-tier nature 
has been ingrained deep in my soul.</i></b>

19:48.820 --> 19:53.960
<b><i>I'm not the one who gets chosen, much 
less the one who gets to choose.</i></b>

19:55.040 --> 19:57.870
<b><i>When Hinami gave me that 
confession hypothetical,</i></b>

19:57.870 --> 20:00.220
<b><i>what governed my mind in that moment</i></b>

20:00.220 --> 20:03.720
<b><i>was an indescribable remorse, 
a sense of guilt...</i></b>

20:04.440 --> 20:08.160
<b><i>"A bottom-tier character like you, 
choosing? Don't get so cocky."</i></b>

20:09.000 --> 20:12.480
<b><i>In other words, an underlying 
feeling of incompetence</i></b>

20:12.480 --> 20:15.720
<b><i>controlling my thoughts in this game of life.</i></b>

20:16.270 --> 20:20.360
<b><i>And it had nested deep within me.</i></b>

20:21.420 --> 20:23.490
<b>I see.</b>

20:23.760 --> 20:24.430
<b>Mmm.</b>

20:25.060 --> 20:30.340
<b>So I find this kind of 
stuff hard to talk about.</b>

20:30.860 --> 20:33.500
<b>I'm really sorry I couldn't be more helpful.</b>

20:59.610 --> 21:00.360
<b>Brain!</b>

21:02.160 --> 21:04.960
<b>Mimimi? Don't scare me like that!</b>

21:04.960 --> 21:06.860
<b>Your fault for being wide open.</b>

21:07.180 --> 21:08.480
<b>Says who?</b>

21:08.480 --> 21:10.990
<b>Still at it at this hour, eh?</b>

21:10.990 --> 21:14.250
<b>Did you have a little 
one-on-one with Kikuchi, hmm?</b>

21:14.510 --> 21:18.250
<b>Uh... I guess so.</b>

21:28.560 --> 21:29.890
<b>Okay, see you.</b>

21:30.130 --> 21:31.760
<b>By the way, Mr. Tomozaki...</b>

21:31.760 --> 21:32.890
<b>Wh-What now?</b>

21:33.250 --> 21:36.390
<b>Who on earth is this Gumi person?</b>

21:37.050 --> 21:40.770
<b>Oh, she's this girl who 
works with me and Mizusawa.</b>

21:40.770 --> 21:43.280
<b><i>Really</i>? Is that <i>all</i> she is?</b>

21:43.280 --> 21:45.510
<b>Seems pretty fishy to me!</b>

21:45.510 --> 21:49.740
<b>My sources tell me you went 
to her culture festival.</b>

21:50.060 --> 21:52.480
<b>Y-Yeah, because she invited us.</b>

21:52.480 --> 21:56.360
<b>That's fishy, all right! She 
goes to an all-girls school!</b>

21:56.360 --> 21:58.610
<b>What's that got to do with it?</b>

21:59.750 --> 22:01.250
<b>It's just, you know...</b>

22:01.940 --> 22:05.510
<b>You don't seem like the 
going-to-festivals-at-girls'-schools type.</b>

22:06.290 --> 22:09.260
<b>Like they'd arrest me if I 
went into a girls' school?</b>

22:09.780 --> 22:12.250
<b>Oh, man, not this again...</b>

22:12.250 --> 22:13.760
<b>"This" what, exactly?</b>

22:14.500 --> 22:15.770
<b>Never mind!</b>

22:17.320 --> 22:23.730
<b>You know, when you're cool, you're 
cool, but when you're not... <i>wow</i>.</b>

22:23.730 --> 22:25.080
<b>Y-Yeah?</b>

22:25.080 --> 22:27.150
<b>Wait, are you saying I'm cool sometimes?</b>

22:27.150 --> 22:28.860
<b>You are!</b>

22:28.860 --> 22:32.990
<b>You're helpful in so many ways, you 
did so much for Tama—all that stuff!</b>

22:33.310 --> 22:35.200
<b>Oh.</b>

22:36.900 --> 22:39.710
<b>I respect you, Brain, you know that?</b>

22:39.950 --> 22:40.710
<b>Huh?</b>

22:40.970 --> 22:43.710
<b>I've told you you're like Tama, right?</b>

22:43.710 --> 22:46.460
<b>A scaredy-cat, sure, but 
you'll still go all-out,</b>

22:46.460 --> 22:49.720
<b>and you head straight 
for what you want to do.</b>

22:51.470 --> 22:52.470
<b>It's like...</b>

22:52.860 --> 22:58.350
<b>You just go ahead and do all these 
things I <i>want</i> to do, but can't.</b>

22:58.600 --> 23:00.620
<b>I think that's really wonderful.</b>

23:01.950 --> 23:04.360
<b>And that right there?</b>

23:05.620 --> 23:07.360
<b>That's what I like about you.</b>

23:12.770 --> 23:16.280
<b>You thought I meant I liked you 
<i>that</i> way just now, didn't you!</b>

23:16.280 --> 23:18.840
<b>N-No... Jeez.</b>

23:19.750 --> 23:23.330
<b>I actually do, though...
like you that way.</b>

23:28.180 --> 23:28.970
<b>See ya!</b>

23:38.230 --> 23:38.940
<b>Huh?!</b>
